battalion-entity 1
id tree-round
display-name Round Tree
description Catalog terrain tile editable through the shared map instance model.
kind terrain
editor-category trees
editor-color tree
editor-placeable yes
placement tile
model round-tree
texture tree-wood
texture-node round-trunk
render-node round-trunk
render-node round-crown
collision-mode solid
movement stationary
vertical-offset 0
collision-radius 0.25
collision-height 1.5
destructible yes
destruction-projectile projectile-debris
destruction-effect explosion-standard
destruction-sound crash
destruction-debris-count 7
destruction-fire-count 3
destruction-effect-count 1
debris-life 420
destruction-fire-projectile projectile-flame
casts-shadow yes
